suggested by them; *preciosity* is limited to literary or artistic style, *maturity* suggests the moment of reaching rather than the state of matureness, *purity* & *frailty* take a sexual tinge that *pureness* & *frailness* are without, *poverty* is more nearly confined to lack of money than *poorness*.
